        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Disney\n- Characters: Figaro, Mickey Mouse\n- Films/Series: Mickey's Once Upon a Christmas, Mickey\n- Concepts: Disney cartoon series with character-specific opening logos\n\nFacts:\n- Disney had seven characters who were given their own cartoon series that opened with their own logo.\n- Figaro is the kitten among those Disney characters with their own logo-opening cartoon series.\n- Figaro also appeared in Mickey's Once Upon a Christmas.\n- Figaro is a fictional character who first appeared in Disney's Mickey.",
