        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "a3d1c9e7-f200-52ee-b203-f29cc84e7bec",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Characters: Humphrey the Bear, Figaro, Mickey Mouse, Donald Duck, Goofy, Pluto, Chip 'n' Dale, Minnie Mouse, Pete, Max, Daisy Duck, Huey, Dewey, Louie, Scrooge McDuck, Mortimer Mouse, Owl, Clarabelle Cow, Horace Horsecollar, Beagle Boy\n- Works: Disney shorts division, Pinocchio, Mickey's Once Upon a Christmas\n\nFacts:\n- Figaro is a fictional Disney character who first appeared in the film \"Pinocchio\".\n- When Disney's shorts division closed, Humphrey the Bear was the last of only seven Disney characters to have their own cartoon series that opened with their own logo.\n- The other six Disney characters with their own logo-opening cartoon series were Mickey Mouse, Donald Duck, Goofy, Pluto, Chip 'n' Dale as a pair, and Figaro.\n- \"Mickey's Once Upon a Christmas\" features Mickey Mouse, Minnie Mouse, Pluto, Pete, Goofy, Max, Donald Duck, Daisy Duck, Huey, Dewey, Louie, Scrooge McDuck, Mortimer Mouse, Figaro the Kitten, and Chip 'n' Dale.\n- \"Mickey's Once Upon a Christmas\" also includes cameos by Owl, Clarabelle Cow, Horace Horsecollar, and a Beagle Boy.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
